                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Remember that Novus is not a single world, but a collection of Shards in different skies. And those Shards have begun to... radiate blended magicks.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreWL_002.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Polaris, Marleybone, Monquista and Valencia have declared them a threat. We do not yet know how they plan to retaliate, but they blame you.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreWL_003.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Be on your guard as you explore Wallaru. As usual, your achievements so far and the task ahead of you merit a promotion.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreWL_004.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340969,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I hereby confer upon you the rank of <ITALIC>Principal Liaison</ITALIC>. Good luck to you, Wizard. As always, we will be watching.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
